<graphml xmlns="http://graphml.graphdrawing.org/xmlns" xmlns:xsi="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema-instance" xsi:schemaLocation="http://graphml.graphdrawing.org/xmlns http://graphml.graphdrawing.org/xmlns/1.0/graphml.xsd"><key id="d6" for="edge" attr.name="source_id" attr.type="string"/>
<key id="d5" for="edge" attr.name="keywords" attr.type="string"/>
<key id="d4" for="edge" attr.name="description" attr.type="string"/>
<key id="d3" for="edge" attr.name="weight" attr.type="double"/>
<key id="d2" for="node" attr.name="source_id" attr.type="string"/>
<key id="d1" for="node" attr.name="description" attr.type="string"/>
<key id="d0" for="node" attr.name="entity_type" attr.type="string"/>
<graph edgedefault="undirected"><node id="&quot;PEOPLE'S REPUBLIC OF CHINA&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"GEO"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The People's Republic of China is the country where the Personal Information Protection Law was adopted and applies."&lt;SEP&gt;"The People's Republic of China is the geographical location where the regulations regarding personal information processing apply."&lt;SEP&gt;"The People's Republic of China is the sovereign state where the laws and regulations regarding personal information processing are enforced.  It's the geographical location where data must be stored unless specific exceptions apply."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-b2a8064a6294712d680163c4e5f2b061&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-34e103dd49e0435199d7ba0070490fa3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-124263e81aa4861b3ff954415c389034</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;13TH NATIONAL PEOPLE'S CONGRESS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The 13th National People's Congress is the legislative body that adopted the Personal Information Protection Law."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-b2a8064a6294712d680163c4e5f2b061</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;STANDING COMMITTEE OF THE 13TH NATIONAL PEOPLE'S CONGRESS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The Standing Committee of the 13th National People's Congress is the body that held the 30th meeting where the law was adopted."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-b2a8064a6294712d680163c4e5f2b061</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;XI JINPING&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Xi Jinping is the President of the People's Republic of China who promulgated the Personal Information Protection Law."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-b2a8064a6294712d680163c4e5f2b061</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;PERSONAL INFORMATION PROTECTION LAW OF THE PEOPLE'S REPUBLIC OF CHINA&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"This is the law itself, adopted to protect personal information rights and interests, regulate the processing of personal information, and promote the reasonable use of personal information."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-b2a8064a6294712d680163c4e5f2b061</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;AUGUST 20, 2021&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"This is the date the Personal Information Protection Law was adopted and promulgated."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-b2a8064a6294712d680163c4e5f2b061</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;NOVEMBER 1, 2021&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"This is the date the Personal Information Protection Law came into force."&lt;SEP&gt;"This is the date the law came into force."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-e892165d5d39fe39325131368a7c8e29&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b2a8064a6294712d680163c4e5f2b061</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;NATURAL PERSON&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
  <data key="d1">"An individual, as opposed to an organization."&lt;SEP&gt;"Refers to any individual whose personal information is protected under the law."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-e892165d5d39fe39325131368a7c8e29&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b2a8064a6294712d680163c4e5f2b061</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;ORGANIZATION&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Any entity, including companies and government bodies, that processes personal information."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-b2a8064a6294712d680163c4e5f2b061</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;INDIVIDUAL&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A person whose personal information is being processed, possessing rights to consent, withdrawal of consent, and notification regarding data usage."&lt;SEP&gt;"An individual is a natural person whose personal information is subject to the regulations outlined in this text."&lt;SEP&gt;"Any person whose personal information is being processed, according to the legal framework described.  Their rights and interests are central to the regulations."&lt;SEP&gt;"Any single person, as opposed to an organization."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-b2a8064a6294712d680163c4e5f2b061&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8ff4e3011eeb0855c4ad54f1eb00bbe3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-34e103dd49e0435199d7ba0070490fa3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-124263e81aa4861b3ff954415c389034</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;MINOR&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A person under the age of 14, requiring special consent for processing their personal information."&lt;SEP&gt;"A person under the age of 14, whose personal information requires special handling and parental/guardian consent."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-b2a8064a6294712d680163c4e5f2b061&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-124263e81aa4861b3ff954415c389034</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;PARENT OR OTHER GUARDIAN&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Legal representative of a minor, required to give consent for processing the minor's personal information."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-b2a8064a6294712d680163c4e5f2b061</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;PERSONAL INFORMATION PROCESSOR&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A legal entity or individual responsible for processing personal information, subject to the regulations outlined in the provided text.  This could encompass a wide range of organizations and individuals."&lt;SEP&gt;"A personal information processor is an entity (organization or individual) that processes personal information, subject to the regulations outlined in the text."&lt;SEP&gt;"A personal information processor is an entity that processes personal information and is subject to various regulations and obligations regarding data protection, including establishing emergency plans, designating a person in charge, conducting audits, and performing impact assessments."&lt;SEP&gt;"An entity responsible for processing personal information, subject to various regulations and obligations regarding data handling, consent, and notification."&lt;SEP&gt;"Any organization or individual responsible for processing personal information."&lt;SEP&gt;"Any organization or individual that independently determines the purpose and method of processing personal information."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-124263e81aa4861b3ff954415c389034&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e892165d5d39fe39325131368a7c8e29&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-16ff96468cd6ce50b600332542403f54&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b2a8064a6294712d680163c4e5f2b061&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-34e103dd49e0435199d7ba0070490fa3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8ff4e3011eeb0855c4ad54f1eb00bbe3</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;MINOR (BELOW 14)&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A person under the age of 14, whose personal information requires parental or guardian consent for processing."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-8ff4e3011eeb0855c4ad54f1eb00bbe3</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;PARENT OR GUARDIAN&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A legal guardian of a minor, responsible for providing consent for the processing of the minor's personal information."&lt;SEP&gt;"The legal guardian responsible for providing consent for the processing of a minor's personal information."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-8ff4e3011eeb0855c4ad54f1eb00bbe3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-124263e81aa4861b3ff954415c389034</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;ARTICLE 15&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Legal article outlining an individual's right to withdraw consent for personal information processing."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-8ff4e3011eeb0855c4ad54f1eb00bbe3</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;ARTICLE 16&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Legal article prohibiting refusal of products or services based on consent for data processing, with exceptions."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-8ff4e3011eeb0855c4ad54f1eb00bbe3</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;ARTICLE 17&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Legal article detailing the notification requirements for personal information processing."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-8ff4e3011eeb0855c4ad54f1eb00bbe3</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;ARTICLE 18&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Legal article addressing exceptions to notification requirements for confidentiality or unnecessary information."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-8ff4e3011eeb0855c4ad54f1eb00bbe3</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;ARTICLE 19&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Legal article specifying the minimum retention period for personal information."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-8ff4e3011eeb0855c4ad54f1eb00bbe3</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;ARTICLE 20&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Legal article defining responsibilities when multiple processors jointly determine data processing."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-8ff4e3011eeb0855c4ad54f1eb00bbe3</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;ARTICLE 21&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Legal article outlining rules for entrusting personal information processing to third parties."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-8ff4e3011eeb0855c4ad54f1eb00bbe3</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;ARTICLE 22&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Legal article addressing personal information transfer during mergers, divisions, etc."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-8ff4e3011eeb0855c4ad54f1eb00bbe3</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;ARTICLE 23&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Legal article governing the provision of personal information to other processors."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-8ff4e3011eeb0855c4ad54f1eb00bbe3</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;ARTICLE 24&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Legal article addressing fairness and transparency in automatic decision-making using personal information."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-8ff4e3011eeb0855c4ad54f1eb00bbe3</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;ARTICLE 25&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Legal article restricting disclosure of personal information unless consented to or legally required."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-8ff4e3011eeb0855c4ad54f1eb00bbe3</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;ARTICLE 26&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Legal article regulating image capturing and personal identification equipment in public spaces."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-8ff4e3011eeb0855c4ad54f1eb00bbe3</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;CONSENT&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The act of granting permission for the processing of personal information."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-8ff4e3011eeb0855c4ad54f1eb00bbe3</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;WITHDRAWAL OF CONSENT&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The act of revoking previously given permission for the processing of personal information."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-8ff4e3011eeb0855c4ad54f1eb00bbe3</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;STATE CYBERSPACE ADMINISTRATION&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The State cyberspace administration is a government body in China responsible for overseeing the processing of personal information, conducting security assessments, and establishing regulations."&lt;SEP&gt;"The State cyberspace administration is a governmental body responsible for overseeing and regulating the processing and cross-border transfer of personal information in China.  It sets standards, conducts security assessments, and formulates contracts related to data protection."&lt;SEP&gt;"The state cyberspace administration determines which organization can file lawsuits against personal information processors violating the law."&lt;SEP&gt;"The state cyberspace administration is responsible for coordinating the protection of personal information and relevant supervision and administration work."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-16ff96468cd6ce50b600332542403f54&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e892165d5d39fe39325131368a7c8e29&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-34e103dd49e0435199d7ba0070490fa3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-124263e81aa4861b3ff954415c389034</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;STATE ORGAN&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A State organ refers to a government entity within the People's Republic of China.  This law specifies how State organs are allowed to process personal information, subject to specific regulations and limitations to ensure compliance with data protection laws."&lt;SEP&gt;"A government body with responsibilities for personal information protection."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-737a538d85e2897e75f31df035b55774&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-124263e81aa4861b3ff954415c389034</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;OVERSEAS RECIPIENT&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
  <data key="d1">"An entity located outside the People's Republic of China that may receive personal information, subject to specific conditions and regulations."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-124263e81aa4861b3ff954415c389034</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;CRITICAL INFORMATION INFRASTRUCTURE OPERATORS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Organizations managing critical infrastructure whose data handling is subject to stringent regulations and security assessments for cross-border data transfer."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-124263e81aa4861b3ff954415c389034</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;FOREIGN JUDICIAL OR LAW ENFORCEMENT AGENCIES&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Foreign judicial or law enforcement agencies are entities outside of China that may request personal information stored in China."&lt;SEP&gt;"Foreign judicial or law enforcement agencies are entities outside of China that may request personal information stored within China."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-34e103dd49e0435199d7ba0070490fa3</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;OVERSEAS ORGANIZATION OR INDIVIDUAL&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Overseas organizations or individuals are entities outside of China whose personal information processing activities may be subject to restrictions or prohibitions if they damage the personal information rights and interests of Chinese citizens or endanger national security or public interests."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-34e103dd49e0435199d7ba0070490fa3</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;COMPETENT AUTHORITY OF THE PEOPLE'S REPUBLIC OF CHINA&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
  <data key="d1">"This refers to the government body or bodies within the People's Republic of China authorized to approve requests for personal information from foreign entities."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-34e103dd49e0435199d7ba0070490fa3</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;NEAR RELATIVES&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Near relatives are individuals related to a deceased person, who may exercise the deceased's rights to their personal information."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-34e103dd49e0435199d7ba0070490fa3</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;DECEASED&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A deceased natural person whose personal information rights may be exercised by their near relatives."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-34e103dd49e0435199d7ba0070490fa3</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;DEPARTMENTS PERFORMING DUTIES OF PERSONAL INFORMATION PROTECTION&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
  <data key="d1">"These departments are responsible for enforcing the personal information protection law, including formulating rules, conducting investigations, and handling complaints."&lt;SEP&gt;"These departments are responsible for protecting, supervising, and administering personal information within their respective duties, including publicity and education, complaint processing, and investigation of illegal activities."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-737a538d85e2897e75f31df035b55774&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-16ff96468cd6ce50b600332542403f54</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;RELEVANT DEPARTMENTS UNDER THE STATE COUNCIL&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
  <data key="d1">"These departments are responsible for protecting, supervising, and administering personal information within their respective duties in accordance with the provisions of this Law and relevant laws and administrative regulations."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-16ff96468cd6ce50b600332542403f54</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;LOCAL PEOPLE'S GOVERNMENTS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Local people's governments at or above the county level have duties in protecting, supervising, and administering personal information as determined by relevant State provisions."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-16ff96468cd6ce50b600332542403f54</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;PERSON IN CHARGE OF PERSONAL INFORMATION PROTECTION&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
  <data key="d1">"This individual is responsible for supervising the processing of personal information and the adopted protection measures within a personal information processor."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-16ff96468cd6ce50b600332542403f54</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;REPRESENTATIVE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A representative, designated by a personal information processor outside of China, is responsible for relevant matters of personal information protection within the territory of China."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-16ff96468cd6ce50b600332542403f54</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;LAWS AND ADMINISTRATIVE REGULATIONS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The overarching legal framework governing personal information processing in the context of the document."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-16ff96468cd6ce50b600332542403f54</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;PERSONAL INFORMATION&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Data related to an individual, subject to the protection measures and regulations outlined in the text."&lt;SEP&gt;"The data subject to protection under the law."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-737a538d85e2897e75f31df035b55774&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-16ff96468cd6ce50b600332542403f54</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;SENSITIVE PERSONAL INFORMATION&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A subset of personal information with heightened protection needs, requiring specific processing considerations."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-16ff96468cd6ce50b600332542403f54</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;AUTOMATIC DECISIONS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Decisions made based on automated processing of personal information, subject to impact assessment requirements."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-16ff96468cd6ce50b600332542403f54</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;OVERSEAS PARTIES&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Entities outside the People's Republic of China, requiring specific considerations for data transfer and protection."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-16ff96468cd6ce50b600332542403f54</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;PERSONAL INFORMATION PROTECTION IMPACT ASSESSMENT&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A process for evaluating potential risks and impacts of processing personal information, as mandated by the regulations."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-16ff96468cd6ce50b600332542403f54</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;PERSONAL INFORMATION LEAKAGE, FALSIFICATION, OR LOSS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Events that require immediate remedial measures and notification to relevant parties."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-16ff96468cd6ce50b600332542403f54</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;IMPORTANT INTERNET PLATFORM SERVICES&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Online services with significant user bases and complex operations, subject to enhanced personal information protection obligations."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-16ff96468cd6ce50b600332542403f54</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;COMPLIANCE SYSTEM FOR PERSONAL INFORMATION PROTECTION&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A system designed to ensure adherence to regulations and best practices for handling personal information."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-16ff96468cd6ce50b600332542403f54</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;SOCIAL RESPONSIBILITY REPORT&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A report on personal information protection practices, publicly released to foster accountability."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-16ff96468cd6ce50b600332542403f54</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;ELECTRONIC IDENTITY AUTHENTICATION TECHNOLOGY&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"TECHNOLOGY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Technology used for secure and convenient online identity verification."&lt;SEP&gt;"Technology used for verifying online identities, promoted for enhancing security."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-737a538d85e2897e75f31df035b55774&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-16ff96468cd6ce50b600332542403f54</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;PERSONAL INFORMATION PROCESSORS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Organizations or individuals that process personal information, subject to the regulations and potential penalties outlined in the law."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-737a538d85e2897e75f31df035b55774</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;PUBLIC SECURITY ORGAN&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The law enforcement agency responsible for handling criminal cases related to illegal personal information processing."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-737a538d85e2897e75f31df035b55774</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;PEOPLE'S PROCURATORATE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A governmental body that may take action in cases of widespread personal information infringement."&lt;SEP&gt;"The people's procuratorate can file lawsuits against personal information processors violating the law."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-737a538d85e2897e75f31df035b55774&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e892165d5d39fe39325131368a7c8e29</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;CONSUMER ORGANIZATIONS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Consumer organizations, as specified by law, can file lawsuits against personal information processors violating the law."&lt;SEP&gt;"Organizations that may be involved in addressing personal information infringements affecting a large number of individuals."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-737a538d85e2897e75f31df035b55774&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e892165d5d39fe39325131368a7c8e29</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;LEGAL REPRESENTATIVE OR PERSON CHIEFLY IN CHARGE OF THE PERSONAL INFORMATION PROCESSOR&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The individual ultimately responsible for the actions of a personal information processor."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-737a538d85e2897e75f31df035b55774</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;THE PERSON DIRECTLY IN CHARGE OF THE PROCESSOR AND OTHER DIRECTLY LIABLE PERSONS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Individuals directly responsible for illegal personal information processing within an organization."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-737a538d85e2897e75f31df035b55774</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;COMPLAINANTS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Individuals who file complaints regarding illegal personal information processing."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-737a538d85e2897e75f31df035b55774</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;REPORTERS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Individuals who report illegal personal information processing."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-737a538d85e2897e75f31df035b55774</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;SMALL PERSONAL INFORMATION PROCESSORS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
