  <data key="d2">chunk-737a538d85e2897e75f31df035b55774</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;PEOPLE'S COURT&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The people's court is responsible for determining compensation amounts in cases of personal information processing violations."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-e892165d5d39fe39325131368a7c8e29</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;PEOPLE'S GOVERNMENTS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Governments at all levels, responsible for statistical and archive administration."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-e892165d5d39fe39325131368a7c8e29</data>
</node>
