  <data key="d3">9.0</data>
  <data key="d4">"Important internet platforms must establish and maintain a robust compliance system for personal information protection."</data>
  <data key="d5">"compliance, best practices"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-16ff96468cd6ce50b600332542403f54</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;PERSONAL INFORMATION PROCESSORS&quot;" target="&quot;THE PERSON DIRECTLY IN CHARGE OF THE PROCESSOR AND OTHER DIRECTLY LIABLE PERSONS&quot;">
  <data key="d3">20.0</data>
  <data key="d4">"The individuals named are directly responsible for the actions of the personal information processor, and will face penalties for violations."</data>
  <data key="d5">"accountability, liability"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-737a538d85e2897e75f31df035b55774</data>
</edge>
